WEBVTT

00:13.400 --> 00:14.640
Your Majesty

00:14.720 --> 00:16.120
Yesterday Fan Zhong

00:16.200 --> 00:17.840
Brought memorials to me

00:17.920 --> 00:19.587
I won't worry about them

00:19.720 --> 00:21.120
My lady, handle them

00:21.360 --> 00:22.760
Yes

00:23.200 --> 00:24.600
Help me change clothes
